@u_lar_be_HostAddress = http://localhost:5116

### OpenAPI document

GET {{u_lar_be_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json


### Login Admin

POST {{u_lar_be_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Get Students

GET {{u_lar_be_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Admin/students
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..IFNmXsyYcYoQrXoHx6VC5Yy_gvyz1C0zAKKEtnY8yKA
Accept: application/json


### Get Students - cari & filter

# search cocok dengan NIM, nama, atau email. isActive menyaring status.
GET {{u_lar_be_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Admin/students?search=budi&isActive=true
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..IFNmXsyYcYoQrXoHx6VC5Yy_gvyz1C0zAKKEtnY8yKA
Accept: application/json


### Get Students - halaman 2

# Paging diproses di server: page mulai 1, pageSize default 30 (maks 100).
GET {{u_lar_be_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Admin/students?page=2&pageSize=30
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..IFNmXsyYcYoQrXoHx6VC5Yy_gvyz1C0zAKKEtnY8yKA
Accept: application/json


### Create Student

POST {{u_lar_be_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Admin/students
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..IFNmXsyYcYoQrXoHx6VC5Yy_gvyz1C0zAKKEtnY8yKA
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

